<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<article xml:lang="de" article-type="research-article">
  <front>
    <article-meta>
      <title-group>
        <article-title>Anchor-Default-Test</article-title>
      </title-group>
    </article-meta>
  </front>
  <body>
    <sec>
      <title>Anchor-Default</title>

      <p>Plain boxed-text ohne @position -> bekommt position="anchor":</p>
      <boxed-text>
        <p>wird anchored</p>
      </boxed-text>

      <p>Epigraph: _blocks wandelt in disp-quote um, boxed-text verschwindet -> kein anchor (Beweis: Anchor-Step greift nur auf ueberlebende boxed-text):</p>
      <boxed-text content-type="epigraph">
        <p>Epigraph-Text</p>
      </boxed-text>

      <p>Parallel-Verse: _blocks re-emittiert boxed-text ohne @position -> Anchor-Step setzt position="anchor" dazu (content-type + anchor):</p>
      <boxed-text content-type="parallel-verse">
        <boxed-text content-type="verse">
          <p>
            <named-content content-type="verse-line">Links</named-content>
          </p>
        </boxed-text>
        <boxed-text content-type="verse-centered">
          <p>
            <named-content content-type="verse-line">Rechts</named-content>
          </p>
        </boxed-text>
      </boxed-text>

      <p>Expliziter anchor: bleibt unveraendert (idempotent):</p>
      <boxed-text position="anchor">
        <p>war schon anchor</p>
      </boxed-text>

    </sec>
  </body>
</article>